    "selection": "The same 623 (clip, person, anchor) windows and 30 consecutive observed target positions are used at every duration, including five frames. The earliest retained anchor is taken, then at least 50 ticks to the next anchor for that clip/person. This complete-track subset has selective coverage relative to the original 1,482 windows."
