    "split": "Four leave-one-site-out fits per model and history length. All four sites have been used in the wider project. No held-out-site early stopping or hyperparameter selection.",
    "inputs": "M0 uses annotated observation coordinates, kinematics and observed ego type; M1 adds historical RTMPose features and their quality. All features end at t0.",
    "models": "Highest-probability of six forecast trajectories, independent of target. ADE averages all 30 Euclidean position errors; FDE uses the observed position at exactly 3.0 seconds. All scores in metres.",
    "baselines": "OLS estimates the planar velocity from the stated suffix of observed positions and extrapolates from the last position. CV_OLS_2 equals the last pair velocity and is identical across durations.",
    "aggregation": "Within-site window means, followed by the unweighted mean of four sites. Positive signed differences mean the first named condition has a larger error.",
    "intervals": "Percentile intervals from 20,000 paired whole-clip bootstrap resamples within each of the four fixed sites (seed 2026). Identical resampling for all models and durations; each site retains equal weight. Unadjusted, exploratory; conditional on the sampled clips, four sites and these fixed fitted models. One training seed excludes inference about training-seed variability.",
    "backend_limitation": "Five- and ten-frame fits ran on Intel Xeon and twenty-frame fits on AMD EPYC. Cross-duration comparisons with twenty frames include a CPU-hardware difference. These results describe the CPU repeat."
  },
